# 🧪 Testing Project

This project is designed to implement **Software Testing** methodologies using Jest, Cypress, and Postman. The project tests authentication, CRUD APIs, and frontend functionalities.

## 📌 Tech Stack
- **Jest** – Unit Testing for Backend
- **Cypress** – End-to-End (E2E) Testing for Frontend
- **Postman** – API Testing

## 📂 Folder Structure
testing_project/ │── tests/ # Jest test cases for backend │── cypress/ # Cypress test cases for frontend │ ├── e2e/ # E2E tests │ │ ├── auth.spec.cy.js # Authentication tests │── server.js # Backend server │── frontend/ # Frontend code │── README.md # Project Documentation

