✅ Test Coverage
The project ensures 80%+ test coverage across the codebase.

📜 Deliverables
Jest Unit Tests: Located in __tests__/
Cypress E2E Tests: Located in cypress/e2e/
Postman API Tests: Manual API validation performed in Postman
Pull Request: testing-setup branch
🎯 Bonus Features
Automated Regression Testing: Runs tests on pull requests.
